rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5007070316","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/issues/70027#issuecomment-5007070316","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/70027","id":5007070316,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAgUK288AAAABKnHUbA","user":{"login":"Fury0508","id":109964042,"node_id":"U_kgDOBo3rCg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109964042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508","html_url":"https://github.com/Fury0508","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-17T20:08:07Z","updated_at":"2026-07-17T20:08:07Z","body":"Hi, I would be interested in working on this once the expected semantics are agreed.\n\nFrom an initial review, I think there are two possible interfaces:\n\n1. Accept an explicit list of task IDs in the backfill API.\n2. Provide a CLI/UI regex or pattern that resolves to that list of task IDs.\n\nBefore implementing it, I would like to clarify how dependencies and DAG-run state should behave.\n\nMy proposed initial semantics would be:\n\n* Only the selected tasks are scheduled.\n* Upstream and downstream tasks are not automatically included.\n* Dependencies on unselected upstream tasks are ignored for this backfill.\n* The request is rejected when the selection matches no tasks.\n* The backfill/DAG run is considered successful based only on the selected tasks.\n* The resolved task IDs are persisted with the backfill so that its behaviour remains reproducible if the DAG later changes.\n\nAlternatively, we could automatically include upstream dependencies, but that may not address the sensor use case described in the issue.\n\nWould this general direction be acceptable? If so, I would be happy to prepare a PR, beginning with the API/model and tests before adding the CLI and UI support.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5007070316/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Fury0508","id":109964042,"node_id":"U_kgDOBo3rCg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109964042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508","html_url":"https://github.com/Fury0508","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury0508/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5193110935","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/issues/70027#issuecomment-5193110935","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/70027","id":519